      <Description>Schedule D (2025): line label "...Form(s) 8949 with Box D or Box J checked" (LT, basis reported). Form 8949 instr. (2025) pp.3–4.</Description>
      <Export mef="true" />
      <ExportZero />
      <Derived>
        <Round>
          <Switch>
